SUNAGAKURE -- KAZEKAGE GUARD DETAIL
Kazekage Office. Restricted.

The guard detail is charged with the protection of Lord Gaara, Fifth Kazekage,
and the security of the Kazekage's tower at the heart of the village.

Composition and duties:
- Standing rotation of trusted jonin and elite chunin posted at the tower and in
  attendance during the Kazekage's public duties and travel (as to the Five Kage
  Summit).
- The Sand Siblings, Temari and Kankuro, stand foremost among the Kazekage's
  protectors as his own kin and most capable shinobi.
- The detail coordinates with border patrol on any threat indicator, above all
  any sign of the Akatsuki, who once abducted the Kazekage from this very village.

Doctrine: The Kazekage protects the village with his person; the detail exists so
that the village is never again left to lose its Kage unguarded. Roster specifics
are held under the highest seal and are not entered in open record.
